# Multi-provider matrix report artifacts: multi_provider_matrix writes
# `tests/reports/multi-provider-<sha>-<provider>.json` and the jq-aggregated
# `multi-provider-<sha>.json`; CI uploads them as build artifacts — they are
# not repo records. Prevents the accidental-commit that stranded stale
# `multi-provider-local-*.json` files in the tree.
tests/reports/multi-provider-*.json
crates/maos-providers/tests/reports/

